  m_Text: 'END OF SHIFT - 22:41


    The badge reader is down. The door stays

    locked
    until the office is put back in order.


    AMBER GLOW = you can pick it up

    BLUE
    OUTLINE = something belongs here


    Put all three back to go home.'
